\ Monomorphized dispatch sites are counted and reported by --compilation-stats.
\
\ Both `inspect` sites see a proven operand (a literal fixnum and float), so each
\ compiles to one direct dispatch call and neither counts as an inline PIC site.
\
\ Build-only: the golden is the --compilation-stats report, pinning the
\ "Monomorphized dispatch sites" line. No fallback inventory appears because
\ the monomorphized sites record none.
30 inspect print-line
2.5 inspect print-line
